The test constructs four different `FontProperties` objects and calls the module-level `findfont` four times. In `lib/matplotlib/font_manager.py`, that name is bound to `fontManager.findfont`, which delegates to `_findfont_cached`; inside `_findfont_cached`, the code iterates over the candidate font list and calls `self.score_family(prop.get_family(), font.name)` once for each candidate examined. Summing those `score_family` invocations over the four distinct `findfont` resolutions in this test gives the total call count.

